    "created_at": "2023-11-13T15:35:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-11-13T15:35:16Z",
    "body": "`<audio>` and `<video>` elements can have nested `<track>` elements that reference [different kinds of subtitles/transcriptions/descriptions](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/media.html#attr-track-kind) in the WebVTT format.\r\n\r\nCan this be leveraged or do the transcriptions have to be encoded in native HTML?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
