    "created_at": "2023-11-14T15:48:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-11-14T15:48:37Z",
    "body": "Regex for VTT cues\r\n`^(\\d{2}:\\d{2}:\\d{2}[.,]\\d{3})\\s-->\\s(\\d{2}:\\d{2}:\\d{2}[.,]\\d{3})\\n(.*(?:\\r?\\n(?!\\r?\\n).*)*)`\r\n\r\nExample Replace pattern\r\n`<cue><a href=#><time>$1</time></a><utterance>$3</utterance></cue>`",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
